# Phase 3 – Create EKS Cluster

Example:

```bash
eksctl create cluster \
--name production-cluster \
--region ap-south-1
```

Verify:

```bash
kubectl get nodes
```

Expected:

```text
NAME             STATUS

node-1           Ready

node-2           Ready
```

