# Phase 5 – Containerize Application

Example Dockerfile:

```dockerfile
FROM nginx

COPY . /usr/share/nginx/html
```

Build:

```bash
docker build -t ecommerce:v1 .
```

Test:

```bash
docker run -p 8080:80 ecommerce:v1
```

---

# Phase 6 – Push Image to ECR

Create repository:

```bash
aws ecr create-repository \
--repository-name ecommerce
```

Authenticate:

```bash
aws ecr get-login-password
```

Push:

```bash
docker push image-url
```

